=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Roskin} to begin the quest. He will say that he is very thirsty and could use a {i:Frontier Soda|Frontier Soda|5944} to quench his thirst.
* Return to {n:Roskin} with a {i:Frontier Soda|Frontier Soda|5944} for a cutscene.
** {i:Frontier Soda|Frontier Soda|5944} can be obtained from {n:Bernegeois} at (G-8) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} for 125 {p:Gil}.

* The next step involves talking to NPCs and checking ??? in the following zones:
** {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds}
*** Check a ??? at (F-6). Use a {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} on it to receive {@k} {k:Royal fiat banning colonization} and 1500 {p:Experience Points}.
**** **Note**: There are treants in this small area that aggro sound. Make sure you've got sneak up.
**** The ??? is on the line between E/F-6.
**** Bivouac #2 is closest.
** {z:Western Adoulin}
*** Talk to Nikkhail at the {p:Pioneers' Coalition} (E-8) to receive {@k} {k:Copy of the alliance agreement} and 150 {p:Experience Points}.
** {z:Eastern Adoulin}
*** Examine the two ???s in the {p:Scouts' Coalition} (F-9) to receive {@k} {k:Record of the 17th Assembly} and 100 {p:Experience Points}, as well as {k:Copy of "Adoulin's Patroness"} and 10 {p:Experience Points}.
**** It may be possible to complete this quest without obtaining {k:Copy of "Adoulin's Patroness"}. __(information needed)__ However, since the ???s are right next to each other, it should make no difference.
** __Optional:__ {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds}
*** Talk to {n:Javolio} (K-9) to receive {@k} {k:Ulbukan navigation chart} and 250 {p:Experience Points}.

* Return to {n:Roskin} who will ask you which documents are important.
** Answer that {@k} {k:Royal fiat banning colonization}, {@k} {k:Record of the 17th Assembly}, and {@k} {k:Copy of the alliance agreement} are important **but not** {@k} {k:Copy of "Adoulin's Patroness"} or {@k} {k:Ulbukan navigation chart}.
*** Even if you did not obtain the {@k} {k:Ulbukan navigation chart}, he may still ask about it.
* You will then be rewarded with 500 {p:Bayld} and asked to come back another day.
* Speak to {n:Roskin} again after waiting 1 game day. He explains that after paying off his debts he doesn't have much of a reward for you. However, he gives you an additional 500 {p:Bayld} and says that he'll make it up to you in the future.
** If you told him that all 5 pages were important he will only give you 2 {p:Bayld} as a reward.

